pump: licensing overview
========================

Unless a folder or file says otherwise, pump's source code and the plugins built from it are

    Copyright (c) 2026 wake. All rights reserved.

No licence to copy, modify or redistribute that code is granted by this repository being visible.


Exception: pump MACHINE (plugins/machine/)
------------------------------------------

pump MACHINE is built on drum machine firmware that is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3
(GPL-3.0-only, with the additional permission and terms in plugins/machine/fw/firmware/NOTICE.md). It is therefore
free software under those terms, together with the pump code that is compiled into it, which wake licenses under the
same terms *as part of pump MACHINE*. The full text is in plugins/machine/fw/LICENSE; the details, the list of what
is covered and the modified-version statement are in plugins/machine/NOTICE.md.

That grant covers pump MACHINE and what is built into it. It does not extend to any other pump plugin: the other
plugins do not use plugins/machine/, and tools/check-licence-boundary.sh (run in CI) fails the build if one does.


Third-party components
----------------------

DPF, pffft, NanoVG, pugl, the NAM core, Eigen, the fonts and the firmware keep their own licences. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
